## Task taken
No assignment card existed in `comms/inbox/worker-046.jsonl`, so I took one bounded task from the live queue: the G-NUM criterion **"N0 convergence order measured AND independently replicated"** — class `AF-WCC-SCALAR-SPH`, node `N0`, gate `G-NUM`.

**Why non-duplicative:** every prior replica re-runs the same frozen module `numerics/tests/flat_wave_replication.py` (`8ade1cdc`), which itself lists the axes it never varies: the `r*phi` reduction, Dirichlet origin, Taylor start, leapfrog time integration. I re-derived the order on a discretisation sharing **none** of those: a from-scratch cell-centred finite-volume solve of the unreduced spherical equation `phi_tt = phi_rr + (2/r)phi_r` with DOP853 (`rtol=1e-12`), plus a same-variable method-of-lines control.

